WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:04.690
Speaker 1: Twitter is undeniably collapsing
at this point in time.

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:08.740
The defenders of Elon Musk's takeover insist
everything is fine.

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:13.049
Any user of Twitter, if you're paying attention,
you can tell something is not right on the

00:00:13.049 --> 00:00:14.130
platform.

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:16.390
We now have a new report.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:22.910
Twitter hit by a staggering 59% drop in U.S.
ad sales.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:28.410
Twitter's U.S. ad revenue has plunged dramatically
in the wake of Elon Musk's takeover of the

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:30.259
site, according to The New York Times.

00:00:30.259 --> 00:00:34.020
The newspaper reports an internal Twitter
presentation showed the company's American

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:39.820
ad sales in the five weeks from April one
into early May were at $88 million, a whopping

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:43.430
59% lower than the same period a year earlier.

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:48.050
Unnamed current and former employees say Twitter's
ad sales staff are worried that advertisers

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:52.930
may have throttled spending out of concern
about an increase in hate speech and porn

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:58.180
on the platform, along with a surge in advertisements
for cannabis products and online gambling.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.859
Six ad agency executives say clients continue
to limit Twitter spending out of confusion

00:01:02.859 --> 00:01:07.890
about Musk's changes to the site, as well
as inconsistent support from Twitter.

00:01:07.890 --> 00:01:12.180
Meanwhile, Twitter's head of brand safety
and ad Quality will be leaving.

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:14.550
This was announced three days ago.

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:15.550
This is A.J.

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.659
Brown, Twitter head of brand safety and ad
Quality, has decided to leave.

00:01:20.659 --> 00:01:26.040
Additionally, we found that twitter's head
of trust and safety has resigned.

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:29.130
This is L.A. Irwin told reuters thursday.

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:30.230
She's out.

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:35.930
She has faced criticism for lax protections
against harmful content since musk acquired

00:01:35.930 --> 00:01:37.200
the platform.

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:42.189
Apparently unable to do anything about it,
she has also resigned.

00:01:42.189 --> 00:01:47.850
So listen, i am actually, i don't find this
to be a great thing.

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:51.409
You know, i've been on twitter for a long
time and spent time building a following and

00:01:51.409 --> 00:01:55.590
have made some great contacts on Twitter and
Twitter.

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:57.990
As we know, it has essentially been destroyed.

00:01:57.990 --> 00:02:03.509
The verified feed is now useless because anybody
